#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:5
msgid "class I2C -- a two-wire serial protocol"
msgstr "class I2C -- protokol serial dua kawat"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:7
msgid ""
"I2C is a two-wire protocol for communicating between devices. At the "
"physical level it consists of two lines, ``SCL`` (clock) and ``SDA`` (data)."
" The OpenMV Cam does **not** provide on-board pull-ups on either line -- "
"external pull-ups are required on both ``SCL`` and ``SDA`` for the bus to "
"function."
msgstr ""
"I2C adalah protokol dua kawat untuk komunikasi antar perangkat. Pada level "
"fisik terdiri dari dua jalur, ``SCL`` (clock) dan ``SDA`` (data). OpenMV Cam"
" **tidak** menyediakan pull-up on-board pada salah satu jalur -- pull-up "
"eksternal diperlukan pada ``SCL`` dan ``SDA`` agar bus dapat berfungsi."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:13
msgid ""
"I2C objects are attached to a specific bus and may be initialised at "
"construction time or later via :meth:`init`."
msgstr ""
"Objek I2C terpasang ke bus tertentu dan dapat diinisialisasi pada saat "
"pembuatan atau nanti melalui :meth:`init`\\ ."

